<title>FINLAND: Finnish May PPI fell 0.7 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 5:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish May PPI fell 0.7 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 5:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index fell 0.7 percent in May year-on-year, but rose 0.2 percent month-on-month, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Corrects direction of yr-on-yr movement from a rise to a fall).</p>
<p>		 May 1997	   April 1997	  May 1996</p>
<p>Mth/Mth	+0.2 pct	     +0.2 pct	  -0.3 pct</p>
<p>Yr/Yr	  -0.7 pct	     -1.1 pct	  +0.6 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
